# [MAPRG](../wg/maprg.html)

## Summary

The Measurement and Analysis for Protocols Research Group (MAPRG) met at IETF 127. The session was chaired by Dave Plonka and Mirja Kühlewind. The meeting covered a range of topics, including email security protocols (SPF/DMARC/DKIM), network research measurement data disclosure constraints, Starlink Direct-to-Cell measurements, DANE for web performance, speed test optimization via machine learning (TurboTest), SCONE evaluation for video streaming over satellite, website privacy practice auditing under the CCPA (PrivAudit), and mitigating SPF vulnerabilities using DMARC split alignment.

